    "triggerRule": "A Hyper Gold site triggers four persistent response packages at activation and the first crossing of 25%, 50%, and 75% extraction progress.",
    "populationSymbol": "P is the current minute's desired minimum ordinary population. Rounded counts use the nearest whole enemy, with the listed floor.",
    "warningSeconds": 2,
